         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Why Does a Small Business Need a Professional Logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A <strong>small business logo</strong> is usually the first thing a potential customer sees: on your storefront, Google listing, Instagram profile or business card. A professional logo makes a small business look established and trustworthy, and it anchors every piece of marketing that follows.</p><p>Small businesses rarely have large budgets, so the logo needs to work hard: one design that reads clearly on a sign, a receipt, a T-shirt and a phone screen.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
