         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Where Your Small business Logo Will Appear",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A small business logo has to work in the places your customers actually see it. Logo Austin designs with these uses in mind:</p><div><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Placement</th><th scope=\"col\">Design Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storefront sign or window</strong></td><td>Readable from the street; simple shapes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Google Business Profile and social media</strong></td><td>Square icon that works as a small profile photo</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Business cards and flyers</strong></td><td>Clean wordmark that prints well at small sizes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Receipts, menus and packaging</strong></td><td>One-color version for low-cost printing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Staff shirts and hats</strong></td><td>Embroidery-friendly design</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
