           "html": "<ul><li>Keep it simple enough to draw from memory.</li><li>Check it in black and white before choosing colors.</li><li>Make sure it is legible at the size of a social media profile picture.</li><li>Avoid trendy effects that will look dated in a few years.</li><li>Get vector source files so you never have to redraw it.</li></ul>",
