          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a small business logo cost?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>At Logo Austin, a custom small business logo is priced from $125 to $175. There is no upfront charge; you pay only after approving the final design.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How fast can I get my small business logo?",
